{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardly recovered from a series of catastrophes of the XXII, the world was hit by a new one \u2014 a mysterious object, called the Mandate of Heaven has hit Earth, killing the fifth part of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years later, the MEMORIAL cemetery city was built on the site of a huge crater, in commemoration of the victims. It seems those who died under the ruins began to coming back to life, but in creepy and insane guises.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Mirai Kagami, a young esper who has come to the city with a mission entrusted from a secret organisation, you will have to find out what secrets the MEMORIAL hides, what the Ocean's Lodge is and when the countdown before the Apocalypse will come to an end. The mankind's destiny is up to Mirai's investigation outcome, but the hero is confident in his own abilities \u2014 though he has no idea what destiny is prepared for him indeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 The branching story where the outcome depends on your choices </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Four romantic interests to suit all tastes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Original soundtrack and mesmerizing locations</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Au revoir","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967730/fe741c87ab188a7cc9585c9545a67b8913b7cfc0.jpg"},{"name":"Erased","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967730/df3da8fa6bb1ef6fd1467732e37e4dcec15ed7e5.jpg"},{"name":"The World of Yesterday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967730/ef821533c79691d57f39b9c2093d4ad91f1b4de4.jpg"},{"name":"Feels Like a Wish","path":"https://cdn.ak